Metamap survives strongly

Strip the name:

(\text{problem,state,goal})
\rightarrow
P(\text{route/operator/representation})

That’s meta-policy learning.

It doesn’t directly solve the task.

It learns which solver topology to deploy.

So:

\boxed{\text{Metamap = policy over reasoning configurations}}

I would keep this distinct.

