Semantic Quarry changes category too

Quarry is not an operator.

It is primitive discovery + inventory management.

\text{environment/corpus}
\rightarrow
\text{candidate reusable structures}
\rightarrow
\text{library}

So it belongs in knowledge logistics.

That separates it cleanly from Golden Horde:

Quarry = acquisition.

Golden Horde = deployment.

Metamap = selection.

That’s a much cleaner trio.

